Package: moat-lib-modbus
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
Description: Sans-IO Modbus protocol core
 A dependency-free, sans-IO implementation of the minimal Modbus
 protocol subset used by moat-modbus: PDU encoding/decoding for
 function codes 1,2,3,4,5,6,15,16, plus TCP (MBAP) and RTU framers.
